    {
      "id": "80f683f3eb29-q1",
      "number": 1,
      "question": "If 'A & B' means 'A is the mother of B's mother', 'A # B' means 'A is the sister of B', 'A ^ B' means 'A is the brother of B's father', 'A @ B' means 'A is the wife of B', 'A % B' means 'A is the mother of B' and 'A = B' means 'B is the father-in-law of A', then how is Z related to M in the given expression? Z ^ R # S @ T = M",
      "questionHtml": "<p>If</p>\n\n<p>&#39;A &amp; B&#39; means &#39;A is the mother of B&#39;s mother&#39;,</p>\n\n<p>&#39;A # B&#39; means &#39;A is the sister of B&#39;,</p>\n\n<p>&#39;A ^ B&#39; means &#39;A is the brother of B&#39;s father&#39;,</p>\n\n<p>&#39;A @ B&#39; means &#39;A is the wife of B&#39;,</p>\n\n<p>&#39;A % B&#39; means &#39;A&nbsp;is the mother of B&#39; and</p>\n\n<p>&#39;A = B&#39; means &#39;B&nbsp;is the father-in-law of A&#39;,</p>\n\n<p>then how is Z&nbsp;related to M in the given expression?</p>\n\n<p>Z ^ R # S @ T =&nbsp;M</p>\n",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Son",
          "html": "Son&nbsp;"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "Brother",
          "html": "Brother"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Father",
          "html": "Father"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Brother-in-law",
          "html": "Brother-in-law"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/24/11/F2_Savita_SSC_6-11-24_D060.png\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); width: 239px; height: 139px;\" /></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Thus, Z is M's brother.</p>\n",
      "images": [
