    {
      "id": "80f683f3eb29-q2",
      "number": 2,
      "question": "Read the following statements and answer the questions that follow. A + B means A is the father of B. A - B means A is the brother of B. A * B means A is the mother of B. A & B means A is the sister of B. Which of the following means that T is the maternal uncle of V?",
      "questionHtml": "<p>Read the following statements and answer the questions that follow.</p>\n\n<p>A + B means A is the father of B.</p>\n\n<p>A - B means A is the brother of B.</p>\n\n<p>A * B means A is the mother of B.</p>\n\n<p>A &amp; B means A is the sister of B.</p>\n\n<p>Which of the following means that T is the maternal uncle of V?</p>\n",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "T - R & S * V",
          "html": "T - R &amp; S * V"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "V * S * R + T",
          "html": "V * S * R + T"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "T + S * R - V",
          "html": "T + S * R - V"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "V & R & S - T",
          "html": "V &amp; R &amp; S - T"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p>Option 1) T - R & S * V</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/24/06/F1_Defence_Savita_14-6-24_D191.png\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); width: 195px; height: 93px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>Here, 'T' is the maternal uncle of 'V'.</p>\n",
      "images": [
        "https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/24/06/F1_Defence_Savita_14-6-24_D191.png"
      ],
      "subject": null,
