    {
      "id": "80f683f3eb29-q3",
      "number": 3,
      "question": "In a certain code language, &lsquo;A + B&rsquo; means &lsquo;A is the father of B&rsquo;, &lsquo;A &ndash; B&rsquo; means &lsquo;A is the brother of B&rsquo;, &lsquo;A &times; B&rsquo; means &lsquo;A is the wife of B&rsquo;, and &lsquo;A &divide; B&rsquo; means &lsquo;A is sister of B&rsquo;. If &lsquo;P + Q &times; R + S &divide; T&rsquo;, then how is P related to T?",
      "questionHtml": "<div bis_skin_checked=\"1\"><span style=\"\">In a certain code language,</span></div>\n\n<div bis_skin_checked=\"1\">&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div bis_skin_checked=\"1\"><span style=\"\">&lsquo;A + B&rsquo; means &lsquo;A is the father of B&rsquo;,</span></div>\n\n<div bis_skin_checked=\"1\">&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div bis_skin_checked=\"1\"><span style=\"\">&lsquo;A &ndash; B&rsquo; means &lsquo;A is the brother of B&rsquo;,</span></div>\n\n<div bis_skin_checked=\"1\">&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div bis_skin_checked=\"1\"><span style=\"\">&lsquo;A &times; B&rsquo; means &lsquo;A is the wife of B&rsquo;, and</span></div>\n\n<div bis_skin_checked=\"1\">&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div bis_skin_checked=\"1\"><span style=\"\">&lsquo;A &divide; B&rsquo; means &lsquo;A is sister of B&rsquo;.</span></div>\n\n<div bis_skin_checked=\"1\">&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div bis_skin_checked=\"1\"><span style=\"\">If &lsquo;P + Q &times; R + S &divide; T&rsquo;, then how is P related to T?</span></div>\n",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Father's Brother",
          "html": "<span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Father&#39;s&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Brother</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "maternal grandfather",
          "html": "maternal grandfather"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Father",
          "html": "Father"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Brother",
          "html": "Brother"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p>Preparing the family tree using the following set of symbols:</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"//cdn.testbook.com/images/production/quesImages/qImage64e76136205d737e6c06283f.png\" /></p>\n\n<p>Given:&nbsp;&lsquo;P + Q &times; R + S &divide; T&nbsp;&rArr; P is the father of Q, Q is the wife of R, R is the father of S, S is the sister of T.</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">P is the father of Q</span></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/23/08/F2_Savita_Defence_25-8-23_D28.png\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); width: 41px; height: 113px;\" /></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Q is the wife of R</span></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/23/08/F2_Savita_Defence_25-8-23_D29.png\" style=\"width: 123px; height: 120px;\" /></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">R is the father of S</span></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/23/08/F2_Savita_Defence_25-8-23_D30.png\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); width: 123px; height: 193px;\" /></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">S is the sister of T</span></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/23/08/F2_Savita_Defence_25-8-23_D31.png\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); width: 192px; height: 199px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>Therefore, P will be the maternal grandfather of T.</p>\n\n<p>Hence, the correct answer is &quot;<strong>Option (2)</strong>&quot;.</p>\n",
      "images": [
        "//cdn.testbook.com/images/production/quesImages/qImage64e76136205d737e6c06283f.png",
        "https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/23/08/F2_Savita_Defence_25-8-23_D28.png",
        "https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/23/08/F2_Savita_Defence_25-8-23_D29.png",
        "https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/23/08/F2_Savita_Defence_25-8-23_D30.png",
        "https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/23/08/F2_Savita_Defence_25-8-23_D31.png"
      ],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
