      "question": "If, A + B means &lsquo;A is the mother of B&rsquo;, A - B means 'A is the sister of B', A &times; B means 'A is the brother of B', A &divide; B means &lsquo;A is the daughter of B&rsquo;, how is Y related to Z in the following equation? V &divide; Z - W + Y &times; X,",
      "questionHtml": "<p>If,</p>\n\n<p>A + B means &lsquo;A is the mother of B&rsquo;,</p>\n\n<p>A -&nbsp;B means &#39;A is the sister of B&#39;,</p>\n\n<p>A &times; B means &#39;A is the brother of B&#39;,</p>\n\n<p>A &divide; B means &lsquo;A is the daughter of B&rsquo;,</p>\n\n<p>how is Y related to Z in the following equation?</p>\n\n<p>V &divide; Z - W + Y &times; X,&nbsp;</p>\n",
