      "question": "A % B means &lsquo;A is the daughter of B&rsquo; A = B means &lsquo;A is the sister of B&rsquo; A $ B means &lsquo;A is the father of B&rsquo; X % Y = Z % W $ V, then how is Z related to V?",
      "questionHtml": "<p>A % B means &lsquo;A is the daughter of B&rsquo;</p>\n\n<p>A = B means &lsquo;A is the sister of B&rsquo;</p>\n\n<p>A $&nbsp;B means &lsquo;A is the father of B&rsquo;</p>\n\n<p>X % Y = Z % W $ V, then how is Z related to V?&nbsp;</p>\n",
