      "id": "80f683f3eb29-q7",
      "number": 7,
      "question": "In a certain code language, A + Z means 'A is the mother of Z', A - Z means 'A is the brother of Z', A &times; Z means 'A is the sister of Z', A &divide; Z means 'A is the daughter of Z'. Based on the above, how is J related to L, if &lsquo;J + K &divide; L - T &times; R'?",
      "questionHtml": "<p>In a certain code language,</p>\n\n<p>A + Z means &#39;A is the mother of Z&#39;,</p>\n\n<p>A - Z means &#39;A is the brother of Z&#39;,</p>\n\n<p>A &times; Z means &#39;A is the sister of Z&#39;,</p>\n\n<p>A &divide; Z means &#39;A is the daughter of Z&#39;.</p>\n\n<p>Based on the above, how is J related to L, if &lsquo;J + K &divide; L - T &times; R&#39;?</p>\n",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Mother",
          "html": "Mother"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "Husband's sister",
          "html": "Husband&#39;s sister"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Wife",
          "html": "Wife"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Sister",
          "html": "Sister"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Family Chart:</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/01/Common_Diagram_28.01.2020_D3.png\" style=\"width: 208px; height: 280px;\" /></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Decoding the Symbols:</p>\n\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); width: 400px;\">\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Symbol</span></td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">+</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">-</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&times;</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&divide;</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Meaning</span></td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); text-align: center;\">Mother</span></td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); text-align: center;\">Brother</span></td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Sister</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Daughter</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Given:&nbsp;J + K &divide; L - T &times; R</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">It means: J&nbsp;is the&nbsp;<span style=\"text-align: center;\">Mother&nbsp;</span>of K, K&nbsp;is the Daughter of L, L&nbsp;is the Brother<span style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</span>of T, T&nbsp;is the Sister of R.</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/24/01/F2_Pranali_SSC_30-12-23_D16.png\" style=\"width: 270px; height: 123px;\" /></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">So, J&nbsp;is the &#39;Wife&#39; of L.</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Hence, the correct answer is&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">&quot;Option 3&quot;</span>.</p>\n",
      "images": [
        "https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/01/Common_Diagram_28.01.2020_D3.png",
        "https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/24/01/F2_Pranali_SSC_30-12-23_D16.png"
      ],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "80f683f3eb29-q8",
      "number": 8,
      "question": "If 'M + N' means 'M is the father of N', 'M &times; N' means M is the mother of N', M &divide; N' means 'M is the sister of N': then how is P related to S in 'P &times; Q + R &divide; S?",
      "questionHtml": "If &#39;M + N&#39; means &#39;M is the father of N&#39;, &#39;M &times; N&#39; means M is the mother of N&#39;, M&nbsp;&divide; N&#39; means &#39;M is the sister of N&#39;: then how is P related to S in &#39;P &times; Q + R&nbsp;&divide; S?",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Granddaughter",
          "html": "Granddaughter"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "Father",
          "html": "Father"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Grandmother",
          "html": "Grandmother"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Mother",
          "html": "Mother"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); --darkreader-inline-color: #d1cdc7;\">Let us first decode the given symbols and then draw a family tree.</p>\n\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); --darkreader-inline-color: #d1cdc7; width: 500px;\">\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td colspan=\"4\" style=\"width: 320px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">M is</span></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 68px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Symbol</span></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 64px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">+</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 61px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">&times;</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 71px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">&divide;</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 68px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Meaning</span></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 64px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">Father</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 61px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">Mother</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 71px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">Sister</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td colspan=\"4\" style=\"width: 320px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Of N</span></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); --darkreader-inline-color: #d1cdc7;\">Now draw a family tree using the following notations:</p>\n\n<p data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); --darkreader-inline-color: #d1cdc7;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https:https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/02/Common_Diagram_28.01.2020_D3.png\" style=\"width: 208px; height: 280px;\" /></p>\n\n<p data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); --darkreader-inline-color: #d1cdc7;\">P &times; Q + R&nbsp;&divide; S</p>\n\n<p data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); --darkreader-inline-color: #d1cdc7;\">P is the mother of Q, Q is the father of R, and R is the sister of S.</p>\n\n<p data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); --darkreader-inline-color: #d1cdc7;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/24/01/F1_Engineering_Arbaz_24-1-24_D1.png\" style=\"width: 113px; height: 199px;\" /></p>\n\n<p data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); --darkreader-inline-color: #d1cdc7;\">Here, P is grandmother of S.</p>\n\n<p data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); --darkreader-inline-color: #d1cdc7;\">Hence, the correct answer is&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">&quot;Grandmother&quot;</span><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">.</span></p>\n",
