      "id": "80f683f3eb29-q10",
      "number": 10,
      "question": "&lsquo;A + B&rsquo; means &lsquo;A is the son of B&rsquo; &lsquo;A &ndash; B&rsquo; means &lsquo;A is the mother of B&rsquo; &lsquo;A &times; B&rsquo; means &lsquo;A is the father of B&rsquo; &lsquo;A &divide; B&rsquo; means &lsquo;A is the brother of B&rsquo; If &lsquo;F &times; G &divide; K &minus; M + S &times; W&rsquo;, then which of the following statements is NOT correct?",
      "questionHtml": "<p>&lsquo;A + B&rsquo; means &lsquo;A is the son of B&rsquo;</p>\n\n<p>&lsquo;A &ndash; B&rsquo; means &lsquo;A is the mother of B&rsquo;</p>\n\n<p>&lsquo;A &times; B&rsquo; means &lsquo;A is the father of B&rsquo;</p>\n\n<p>&lsquo;A &divide; B&rsquo; means &lsquo;A is the brother of B&rsquo;</p>\n\n<p>If &lsquo;F &times; G &divide; K &minus; M + S &times; W&rsquo;, then which of the following statements is NOT correct?&nbsp;</p>\n",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "M is the sister&rsquo;s son of G.",
          "html": "M is the sister&rsquo;s son of G.&nbsp;"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "S is the husband of K.",
          "html": "S is the husband of K."
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "S is the brother of G.",
          "html": "S is the brother of G."
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "G is the wife&rsquo;s brother of S.",
          "html": "G is the wife&rsquo;s brother of S."
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/23/11/Blood%20Relation%20Dia.png\" style=\"width: 220px; height: 298px;\" /></p>\n\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width:230px;\">\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Sign</strong></td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">+</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">-</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&times;</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&divide;</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Relation</strong></td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">son</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">mother</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">father</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">brother</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>Given equation:&nbsp;F &times; G &divide; K &minus; M + S &times; W</p>\n\n<p>The family tree can be drawn using the given information,</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"//cdn.testbook.com/images/production/quesImages/qImage6a6dc22fc7a5ab74fac80d48.png\" /></p>\n\n<p>Now, let&#39;s check each option,</p>\n\n<p>1)&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">M is the sister&rsquo;s son of G&nbsp;&rarr; <strong>True</strong></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">2)&nbsp;S is the husband of K&nbsp;&rarr; <strong>True</strong></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">3)&nbsp;S is the brother of G&nbsp;&rarr; <strong>False</strong></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">4)&nbsp;G is the wife&rsquo;s brother of S&nbsp;&rarr; <strong>True</strong></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Hence, the correct answer is <strong>&quot;S is the brother of G&quot;</strong>.</span></p>\n",
